%description:
Tests the server of a TCP Fast Open connection that sends in SYN_RCVD (RFC
7413 section 4.2.2). The application of the server gets the connection and
the 200 bytes of the SYN at once (TCP_I_ESTABLISHED), and at t=0.5025 s, before
the ACK of its SYN-ACK arrives, it sends 3000 bytes. The algorithm started at
the SYN with the initial window (RFC 7413 section 4.2.2, step 6), so the first
segment goes out at once. The SYN-ACK is not data: the window and Nagle do not
count it. The ACK of the SYN-ACK gives no second indication.
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.fastOpen=true
*.cli_app.tOpen2=0.5s
*.cli_app.active2=true
*.cli_app.localPort2=1001
*.cli_app.tSend2=0.5s
*.cli_app.sendBytes2=200B
*.cli_app.fastOpen2=true
*.srv_app.tOpen2=0.5s
*.srv_app.localPort2=2000

*.srv_app.logIndications=true
*.srv_app.tSend2=0.5025s
*.srv_app.sendBytes2=3000B
*.cli_tcp.fastopenClientEnabled = true
*.srv_tcp.fastopenServerEnabled = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
srv_app: TCP_I_ESTABLISHED
srv_app: TCP_I_DATA, 200 bytes
[0.503 B002] A.1001 < B.2000: A S 125500:125500(0) ack 125201 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
[0.503 B003] A.1001 < B.2000: A 125501:126525(1024) ack 125201 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.505 A004] A.1001 > B.2000: A ack 125501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[0.706 A005] A.1001 > B.2000: A ack 126525 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
TcpTestNet1.cli_app: received 3000 bytes in 3 packets
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
